//! stdlib/math/mod.sio - Mathematical operations and types
//!
//! This module provides mathematical structures and fundamental operations:
//!
//! Core:
//!   - core: Basic mathematical functions (sin, cos, sqrt, exp, log, etc.)
//!   - pure: Pure mathematical functions (no side effects)
//!   - constants: Extended mathematical constants (Catalan, Apery, Khinchin, etc.)
//!
//! Hypercomplex:
//!   - octonion: 8-dimensional hypercomplex numbers for neural networks and physics
//!   - sedenion: 16-dimensional hypercomplex numbers for neural networks
//!
//! Number Theory & Combinatorics:
//!   - number_theory: GCD, primes, Miller-Rabin, factorization, CRT, Euler totient
//!   - combinatorics: Binomial, Stirling, Bell, partition, Bernoulli numbers
//!
//! Transforms & Numerical Methods:
//!   - fft: Fast Fourier Transform (Cooley-Tukey radix-2)
//!   - numdiff: Numerical differentiation (Richardson, complex-step, Jacobian, Hessian)
//!   - approx: Approximation theory (Chebyshev, Pade, Remez minimax)
//!   - interpolation: Barycentric Lagrange, Newton, Hermite, PCHIP, rational
//!
//! Stochastic & Information:
//!   - stochastic_calc: SDEs (Euler-Maruyama, Milstein, GBM, Ornstein-Uhlenbeck)
//!
//! Optimization:
//!   - convex: Proximal operators, FISTA, ADMM, LASSO
//!   - constrained: Augmented Lagrangian, barrier, projected gradient, L-BFGS
//!
//! Algebra:
//!   - lie: Lie algebras (su(2), su(3), so(3)), exp/log maps, BCH, Wigner D-matrices
//!
//! Integral Equations:
//!   - integral_eq: Fredholm, Volterra, Nystrom method, Tikhonov, Green's functions
//!
//! Spectral Methods:
//!   - spectral: Chebyshev collocation, differentiation matrices, spectral BVP/eigenvalue
//!
//! Functional Analysis:
//!   - functional: Operator norms, RKHS interpolation, spectral radius, condition number
//!
//! Machine Learning:
//!   - gp: Gaussian process regression (RBF, Matern, periodic kernels, Cholesky inference)
//!
//! Finite Elements & Solvers:
//!   - fem: 1D/2D finite elements, assembly, CG solver, stress recovery
//!   - multigrid: Geometric multigrid (V/W-cycle, Jacobi/GS smoothers, 1D/2D Poisson)
//!
//! Geometry:
//!   - diffgeo: Riemannian metrics, Christoffel symbols, curvature, geodesics
//!
//! Model Reduction:
//!   - mor: POD, DEIM, greedy basis, Galerkin projection, error bounds

// Note: Direct re-exports not used due to parser limitations
// Import individual modules: use math::core, use math::sedenion, etc.
